title: "iTantra: Offline Multilingual Voice-to-Packet MANET Transceiver"
abstract: "An offline-first Android neural voice communication system designed for low-bandwidth ad-hoc mesh networks, combining on-device speech recognition, compact binary packet transmission, and local neural voice reconstruction."
